@startuml
skinparam Style strictuml
autonumber

actor "Developer / Operator" as User
participant "Pytest Engine" as Pytest
participant "FastAPI (Uvicorn)" as App
participant "Database Engine" as DB

== Production / Local Run Pathway ==
User -> App : Boot application (uvicorn app.main:app)
activate App
App -> DB : init_db() [sys.modules has no pytest]
activate DB
DB --> App : Connection pool configured (Schema creation bypassed 🔒)
deactivate DB
App --> User : Server running (Ready for live traffic / Alembic migrations)
deactivate App

== Test Execution Sandbox Pathway ==
User -> Pytest : Execute tests (pytest)
activate Pytest
Pytest -> DB : setup_test_database_schema fixture -> init_db()
activate DB
Note over DB: "pytest" in sys.modules is TRUE ✅
DB -> DB : Run SQLModel.metadata.create_all
DB --> Pytest : Schema built in isolated test DB file
deactivate DB
Pytest -> Pytest : Execute Sandbox Transaction Tests
Pytest --> User : Test execution results returned (All PASSED)
deactivate Pytest
@endum()
